771-ed10e2e619b7") (property "Reference" "#FLG042" (at 39.37 67.30999999999999 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)) (property "Value" "PWR_FLAG" (at 39.37 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)) (property "Footprint" "" (at 39.37 69.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)) (property "Datasheet" "~" (at 39.37 69.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)) (pin "1" (uuid "d3eae68a-10ab-477e-8c59-2feb1242ffb9")) (instances (project "MP3PlayerPCB_v2" (path "/ac64aa3f-c5fe-4b96-b174-4a36312158e7" (reference "#FLG042") (unit 1))))) (wire (pts (xy 39.37 69.85) (xy 39.37 72.39)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "6ececd9b-447e-4a39-850d-3a2fdbe69d77")) (label "VBAT_IN" (at 39.37 72.39 270) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "6375bfa9-6ba0-44f5-8c08-08bc3b7d01e9")) (text "MAIN BOARD v2 - AI-Thinker ESP32-CAM\n- microSD: ESP32-CAM onboard slot, SDMMC 1-bit (IO14 CLK, IO15 CMD, IO2 D0) - not routed on this board.\n- Display GC9A01: SCLK=IO13, MOSI=IO12, DC=IO0, CS tied low, RST = RC power-on reset (10k/1uF).\n- I2C (PCF8574TS @0x20): SDA=IO3/U0R, SCL=IO1/U0T. Inputs polled; INT unused.\n  P0 ENC_A, P1 ENC_B, P2 ENC_SW (play/pause), P3 NEXT, P4 PREV, P5-P7 spare on J4.\n- IO4 drives the module flash LED: leave unconnected. IO16 is PSRAM CS: never use.\n- IO12 is a strapping pin (flash voltage): nothing may pull it high at reset.\n- IO0 = DC + BOOT button: 10k pull-up keeps it high at reset. To flash: hold BOOT, toggle power, upload via J3.\n- Remove the OV2640 camera (unused; also no height for it under the display).\n- Power: LiPo -> TP4056 Type-C module (charge + DW01 protection, off-board) -> J2 -> SW4 -> AP2112K-3.3." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "82bff1cb-049c-42f2-8e66-59ae07edff9e")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))